{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010The land is merciless\u3011</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The land is testing you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summoned by a mysterious force, you proceed to meet the harsh demands of the land!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010Base system\u3011</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It has a JRPG atmosphere, with gathering and simple combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is a simulation in genre, although it has various elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can get placements in the field, set them up in unique rooms, collect them, etc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most of the collection can be Idle, and each parameter, such as the number of items acquired and the speed of collection, is affected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also grow your parameters along the way, so train and get over it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010Objects gradually increasing\u3011</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The number of objects to be placed will gradually increase.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, there are objects for collecting, but there are also objects for processing and creating by combining materials.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many of them are even unique with their own functions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010Convenient warp function\u3011</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is a convenient feature that allows you to memorize a favorite location on the land and fly to it at any time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010Profit from playing time\u3011</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The use of meals allows for a special time to elapse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the special time reaches its maximum value, the special time is reset and benefits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are items that increase this profit itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010Localization\u3011</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developers used their own localization methods to prioritize the pace of development.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Arrival at the Green Ordeal !!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3866730/8168d3584a0cbbe1078c46d245726943b832e533.jpg"},{"name":"Arrival at the White Temple !!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3866730/decd0a7e2a0ae29c5a76af9e1465f13c34199017.jpg"},{"name":"Arrival at the Pocomid !!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3866730/c143d388dd5ecbe3d842e4b135b76d8a472a1abe.jpg"},{"name":"Arrival at the Ruins of Land !!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3866730/116292b6928863ff5007d2aea3bf4c6526b574c8.jpg"},{"name":"Arrival at the Telepo Gate !!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3866730/35d4a01e65b7b2b469f3b53c865e13bc26131c1c.jpg"},{"name":"Red and Blue challenge was overcome!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3866730/d047bd2dc4a96b0f1588f316b9e0f3d38167d1ad.jpg"},{"name":"Start exploring the Large Forest!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3866730/678eccb4405211f00804b477d364389fad12fd2e.jpg"},{"name":"Arrival at the Vase Road !!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3866730/87ea3cc210206fb1a87f7d15004238834c38f0e5.jpg"},{"name":"Arrival at the Dirty Hall !!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3866730/a4edaf6265da43a5d4e8034147c6f1839a4e3893.jpg"},{"name":"Start exploring the Large Underground Cavern!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3866730/db5e1