lass=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010Objects gradually increasing\u3011</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The number of objects to be placed will gradually increase.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, there are objects for collecting, but there are also objects for processing and creating by combining materials.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many of them are even unique with their own functions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010Convenient warp function\u3011</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is a convenient feature that allows you to memorize a favorite location on the land and fly to it at any time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010Profit from playing time\u3011</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The use of meals allows for a special time to elapse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the special time reaches its maximum value, the special time is reset and benefits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are items that increase this profit itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010Localization\u3011</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developers used their own localization methods to prioritize the pace of development.</p>","developers":["POCOYA"],"genres":[{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866730/2e60a090ec284028d998b53cbfaa1a68d4a74b35/header.jpg?t=1755457594","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https: